--- .gitignore (原始)
```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp

# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Dependencies
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
target/
```

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
Nothing should be ignored since only a Python source file (`orchestrator_bot.py`) was added without any build artifacts, dependencies, or temporary files.
